    99	**Bar and card rules (Round 4, 2026-11-02):** a bar notice that is the result of an action ("Couldn't confirm…", "Prescribe or disable…") sits inside the action bar above its button (RULES §9.5, A-19). Cards on the case page and Prescribe are 16 apart; the end-of-call script card has 16 padding below in every state (B-03, B-04, B-05). The callback-scheduled card uses the calendar icon and the patient-unavailable card the phone-off icon, the same icons as their buttons (B-22). A two-line patient name makes the header taller, not tighter (B-06). Long medicine titles wrap balanced (B-13).
