   204	- **Confirm callback** closes the case (status card "Callback today at 3:00 PM"). The case goes to the callback pool, not back to this doctor (D-36) `[MOCK: the app treats it as closed for this session]`. Save failure: notice in the sheet, choices kept.
   205	- **Available only on 6 Call too short and 7d Result not received** (CW-A1, CW-C3; D-83). Never on a live call. The sheet opens over that post-call state, never over Calling. The backend refuses a callback unless the patient answered (leg 2): error "Couldn’t schedule a callback. The patient wasn’t reached." (K3).
   206	
   207	**Patient unavailable** (D-51)
   208	- **Automatic** when the patient side fails (§5, state 9), whenever detected — the partner's reason is stored; no sheet. The case goes on hold and the system retries it by hangup cause; an invalid number is not retried (CW-B2). Nothing goes to Ops.
   209	- **By the doctor** only in 7d (result not received); state 6 has no Unavailable (D-58 pt 23). **Unavailable** opens the reason sheet "Mark patient unavailable" (D-75): Didn't answer · Not reachable · Wrong number. Choosing a reason closes the case at once (it is the confirmation); × backs out with no change. **The reason is saved with the case** for Ops monitoring (D-73).
   210	- Status card "Patient unavailable" with a neutral icon; medicines keep their status (Pending stays Pending).
   211	
